<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MacAdams interim shr jumps, no div.</title>
<headline>MacAdams interim shr jumps, no div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	20.5	 vs 11.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    3.74	 vs 1.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    5.71	 vs 2.02</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.97	 vs 0.09</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.04	 vs 0.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		  49.59	 vs 30.70</p>
<p>Full name: MacAdams Bakery Supplies Holding Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it had not declared an interim dividend as it had changed its dividend policy to declare a single final dividend in March 1997, payable in April 1997.</p>
<p>The group said that with orders on hand, it expected to meet targets for the next six months.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
